OL,3,GNEWSA'There should have been more
OL,4,Aplanning over wildfires'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Michael Morgan spotted flames
OL,7,Ftearing along a road in Stourbridge on
OL,8,Fthe hottest day of the year, he stopped
OL,9,Fhis car to ring 999.
OL,11,FHe was shocked to find the call
OL,12,Fanswered by people working for London
OL,13,FFire Brigade, some 100 miles away.
OL,15,FAs thousands of people rang the West
OL,16,FMidlands service to report lots of
OL,17,Ffires breaking out on 13 August -
OL,18,Fincluding the devastating Stourbridge
OL,19,Fwildfire - calls had to be diverted
OL,20,Felsewhere.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
