OL,3,GNEWSA'There should have been more
OL,4,Aplanning over wildfires'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn total, London Fire Brigade said it
OL,7,Fanswered 754 calls in support of West
OL,8,FMidlands Fire Service and Staffordshire
OL,9,FFire Service, as part of national
OL,10,Farrangements.
